# Default-deny build context: only what the Dockerfile copies.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.lock
!src/
!backend/
!data/
!policies/
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
!frontend/index.html
!frontend/evidence.html
!frontend/dashboard.html
!frontend/scenarios.html
!frontend/proof.html
!frontend/vite.config.js
!frontend/src/
!frontend/public/
# (r32) The hosted guide's Gemini worker profile; never its local .venv.
!integrations/gemini/worker.py
!integrations/gemini/check_runtime.py
!integrations/gemini/pyproject.toml
!integrations/gemini/requirements.lock
!integrations/gemini/run.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
